    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 DEMO LIVE! \ud83e\udd16 Ready to bounce your way to glory? The Retro Goes Up! demo is now available on Steam! This early-stage demo uses mouse-only controls (controller support coming soon to the full game). Test your precision jumping skills and get a taste of our addictive &quot;just one more try&quot; gameplay. Download free now and share your feedback!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOUNCE Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce your way to glory in this charming physics-based platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide an adorable robot through challenging levels using precise jumps, combining the satisfying physics of mini-golf with precision-style platforming action. Experience the perfect fusion of mini-golf physics and platforming that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 meticulously crafted levels per world (480 total!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level beatable in just 4 jumps\u2014if you've got the skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Everyone</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes to match your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, deeply rewarding to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with lofi beats or compete for speedrun glory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express Yourself</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock robot cosmetics through pure gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions\u2014earn everything by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bouncy companion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Share</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust level editor with intuitive tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your creations with the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability with user-generated content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with the World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your best times and compete globally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community for extra competition and challenges ... with some rewards!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive &quot;Just One More Try&quot; Gameplay</strong> Whether you're perfecting your technique for that elusive 4-jump clear or just bouncing around to relaxing music, Retro Goes Up! delivers that irresistible &quot;just one more level&quot; experience that will keep you coming back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 About the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Goes Up! is a spin-off from the upcoming survival game Retro Inc, introducing you to the charming world of Retro Bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <u><strong>Try the Demo!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the bouncy fun firsthand with our free demo! Note: <u><strong>The demo currently supports keyboard and mouse only\u2014controller support is coming soon to the full game.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOUNCE Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce your way to glory in this charming physics-based platformer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide an adorable robot through challenging levels using precise jumps, combining the satisfying physics of mini-golf with precision-style platforming action. Experience the perfect fusion of mini-golf physics and platforming that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 meticulously crafted levels per world (480 total!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level beatable in just 4 jumps\u2014if you've got the skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Everyone</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes to match your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, deeply rewarding to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with lofi beats or compete for speedrun glory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Express Yourself</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock robot cosmetics through pure gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions\u2014earn everything by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bouncy companion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Share</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust level editor with intuitive tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your creations with the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability with user-generated content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with the World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your best times and compete globally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community for extra competition and challenges ... with some rewards!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive &quot;Just One More Try&quot; Gameplay</strong> Whether you're perfecting your technique for that elusive 4-jump clear or just bouncing around to relaxing music, Retro Goes Up! delivers that irresistible &quot;just one more level&quot; experience that will keep you coming back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 About the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Goes Up! is a spin-off from the upcoming survival game Retro Inc, introducing you to the charming world of Retro Bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <u><strong>Try the Demo!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the bouncy fun firsthand with our free demo! Note: <u><strong>The demo currently supports keyboard and mouse only\u2014controller support is coming soon to the full game.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
